// V-2 (A-4) (1944).
// The first rocket to reach space: MW 18014 climbed to 176 km on 20 June 1944.
// Built by hand from plain parts: the tanks stand above the 2.6 m tail section that holds
// the engine and turbopump, and the tonne of the warhead rides in the nose, which is what
// keeps the real one stable on its fins.
